Note on data (data/): the derived and digitised datasets in data/lapangan/ and
data/projects/ are released under the same MIT terms for the numeric values and
code that produced them. These are values extracted or derived by the authors
from published figures/tables of third-party journal articles, with the source
publication cited in every file; the original articles themselves are not
included in this repository and remain under their publishers' copyright.
